OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in suspected scrambler
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been killed following a
OL,7,Fcollision with a vehicle believed to be
OL,8,Fa scrambler motorcycle, gardai (Irish
OL,9,Fpolice) have said.
OL,11,FThe man, who was in his 60s, was hit by
OL,12,Fthe vehicle in Ballina, County Mayo, at
OL,13,Faround 21:25 local time on Friday.
OL,15,FHe was brought to Mayo University
OL,16,FHospital for treatment, but was
OL,17,Fsubsequently pronounced deceased.
OL,19,FGardai are appealing for any witnesses
OL,20,Fto the collision, which occurred in
OL,21,FMercy Park, to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
